Scope of this license
---------------------

This MIT license covers the source code and documentation in this
repository, i.e. the Python scripts, the GitHub Actions workflow, and the
Markdown files.

It does NOT cover the generated rule sets under out/. Those files are
assemblies of third-party blocklists and remain under the licenses of the
upstream projects they are built from -- predominantly GPL-3.0. See
LICENSE-GPL-3.0 for the full text, and the "许可协议" section of README.md
for the per-source breakdown.
